#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, btnPause)
#. +> trunk stable
#: DisplayProcessUi.ui:59
msgid "Pause the process and its output"
msgstr "Den Perzess un de Utgaav anhollen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btnPause)
#. +> trunk stable
#: DisplayProcessUi.ui:62
msgid "Stop reading the output from the process. This will cause the process to be blocked, effectively pausing it. The process can be resumed by resuming, detaching or closing the dialog."
msgstr "Mit dat Lesen vun den Perzess sien Utgaven ophollen. Dat blockeert den Perzess, he mutt föffteihn maken. Du kannst em wiederlopen laten, wenn Du wiedermaakst, dat Beluern afhangst oder den Dialoog tomaakst."

#. i18n: ectx: property (statusTip), widget (QPushButton, btnDetach)
#. +> trunk stable
#: DisplayProcessUi.ui:88
msgid "Stop monitoring the process"
msgstr "Beluern ophollen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, btnDetach)
#. +> trunk stable
#: DisplayProcessUi.ui:91
msgid "Stop monitoring the process and allow the process to resume running."
msgstr "Dat Beluern vun den Perzess ophollen un em wiederlopen laten"

